# Allow-list: nothing enters the build context unless it is named here, so data
# bundles, caches, .git, tests and the viewer sources can never end up in the image.
*

!requirements-cloud.txt
!LICENSE
!xenium_explorer.py
!xenium_viewer_api.py
!xenium_app
!assets
!functions

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
functions/output
